<%--
View_Fields - a group of label/value facts (View_Field children)

default content - the <View_Field> rows

Lays its fields out in a responsive multi-column grid (a single column in a
narrow container such as the sidebar). Replaces the hand-rolled
`.row > .col-md-6 > label + div` fact grids.

Usage:
    <View_Fields>
        <View_Field $label="Email"><%= _client.email %></View_Field>
        <View_Field $label="Phone"><Empty_Value /></View_Field>
    </View_Fields>
--%>
<Define:View_Fields>
    <%= content() %>
</Define:View_Fields>
